# Build context exclusions for the kb-game qmd image.
# The Dockerfile only COPYs ./knowledge and ./skills, so most repo-level
# files are out of context by default. This file mainly trims items inside
# those trees that aren't part of the searchable text.

# Arcs and reviews are PROPOSALS, not facts — never indexed.
# (Defense in depth: the Dockerfile only registers reference/ as collections,
# but excluding them from build context keeps image size honest.)
skills/*/arcs/
skills/*/reviews/

# Binaries (if added later, e.g. design mocks). qmd indexes text only.
knowledge/attachments/

# Git metadata.
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/

# Editor / OS noise.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
